Level:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Equip</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Durability:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Material:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Hardness:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Weight:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Base Value:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">200 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Location:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Winter_Festival\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Winter Festival\">Winter Festival</a></b>, Risian Altar, Upgrade of <a href=\"/page/Item:Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost_(%2B1)\" title=\"Item:Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+1)\">Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+1)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Ray of Frost\">Ray of Frost</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Ray of Frost\">Ray of Frost</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 2<br /><b>Charges: </b>50 (50/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 50 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:50)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +42</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +42</a>:</b> Passive: +42 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Cold <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost_(%2B2).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost_%28%2B2%29.png/420px-Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost_%28%2B2%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"499\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost_%28%2B2%29.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Winter_Festival\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Winter Festival\">Winter Festival</a> to <a href=\"/page/Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost_(%2B3)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+3)\">Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+3)</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A thin rod of gnarled wood containing charges of the Ray of Frost spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">The wand created from recipe 1/20 casts the spell Ray of Frost at caster level 1. Recipe 2/20 can be used up to four times to upgrade this item's caster level and enhancement bonus by 1 each upgrade, up to a maximum of caster level 5 and enhancement bonus +8 (<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">as shown here.<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Item_%2B5_Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Item_%2B5_Eternal_Wand_of_Ray_of_Frost.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"438\" height=\"520\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></span></span>) <i>This wand has been upgraded once.</i>\n<p>The wand is not bound when created, but is automatically <a href=\"/page/Bind#Binds_on_Equip_(BoE)\" title=\"Bind\">bound to character when equipped</a>, so it can be mailed, traded, or auctioned. The wand is <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>; you can only have 1 in your inventory. Attempting to create a 2nd while the first is still in your inventory will fail with an error message, but not consume any ingredients.\n</p><p>The spell's full damage description is stated as \"1d3 +1 per caster level (max 5).\" The 5 refers to the maximum caster level bonus. Maxing out the caster level through multiple recipe 2/20 transmutations will result in a max hit of 8. \n</p><p>As with any wand, this damage can be further improved by <a href=\"/page/Enhancement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhancement\">enhancements</a>. For example, <a href=\"/page/Archmage_enhancements#Tier_One\" title=\"Archmage enhancements\">Tier 1 Archmage</a> Wand and Scroll Mastery I gives a 25% effectiveness bonus to the wand, resulting in a max hit of 10 (125% x 8), etc.\n</p><p><i>As of the 2013 games, the Glaciation Recipes can no longer be applied to this item.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817210008\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2333/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19579/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7029/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.452      1 -total\n 76.14%   37.653      1 Template:Named_item\n 69.15%   34.195      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 38.15%   18.864      4 Template:Popup\n 33.93%   16.779      1 Template:Mat\n 23.78%   11.761      1 Template:History\n 14.71%    7.276     30 Template:IO\n  8.52%    4.211      1 Template:SpellPower\n  8.37%    4.139      1 Template:Edit\n  6.57%    3.249      1 Template:BgColorVar\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:124006-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817210008 and revision id 675988. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{History|item}}\n{{Named item|Eternal wand\n  | name                     = Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+2)\n  | umd                      = 15\n  | noumd                    = Wiz, Sor\n  | minlevel                 = 1\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoE|1}}\n  | durability               = 25\n  | material                 = Wood\n  | hardness                 = 10\n  | cost                     = 200 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | quest                    = Winter Festival\n  | chest                    = Risian Altar, Upgrade of {{Item|Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+1)}}\n  | released                 = Update 3\n  | crafting                 = Winter Festival\n  | craftingupgrade          = Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+3)\n  | description              = A thin rod of gnarled wood containing charges of the Ray of Frost spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.\n  | icon                     = Spell_rayoffrost.jpg\n  | spell                    = Ray of Frost\n  | casterlvl                = 2\n  | charge                   = 50\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Clicky|Ray of Frost|2|50|50}}\n* {{SpellPower|Glaciation|42}}\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | picdesc                  = Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost (+2).png\n  | notes                    = The wand created from recipe 1/20 casts the spell Ray of Frost at caster level 1. Recipe 2/20 can be used up to four times to upgrade this item's caster level and enhancement bonus by 1 each upgrade, up to a maximum of caster level 5 and enhancement bonus +8 ({{Popup|as shown here.|[[File:Item +5 Eternal Wand of Ray of Frost.png|center]]|long=yes}}) ''This wand has been upgraded once.''\n\nThe wand is not bound when created, but is automatically [[Bind#Binds_on_Equip_(BoE)|bound to character when equipped]], so it can be mailed, traded, or auctioned. The wand is [[Exclusive]]; you can only have 1 in your inventory. Attempting to create a 2nd while the first is still in your inventory will fail with an error message, but not consume any ingredients.\n\nThe spell's full damage description is stated as \"1d3 +1 per caster level (max 5).\" The 5 refers to the maximum caster level bonus. Maxing out the caster level through multiple recipe 2/20 transmutations will result in a max hit of 8. \n\nAs with any wand, this damage can be further improved by [[enhancement]]s. For example, [[Archmage_enhancements#Tier_One|Tier 1 Archmage]] Wand and Scroll Mastery I gives a 25% effectiveness bonus to the wand, resulting in a max hit of 10 (125% x 8), etc.\n\n''As of the 2013 games, the Glaciation Recipes can no longer be applied to this item.''\n}}",
